msgid "原生内核模块与 SDK"
msgstr "Native Kernel Modules and SDK"

msgid "兼容边界"
msgstr "Compatibility Boundaries"

msgid ""
"ReliefNT 使用 Linux 风格的 ELF64 .ko、Kbuild、模块元数据和符号版本机制。 模块必须针对匹配的 ReliefNT 内核重新编译；Linux 的内部内核 API 和原版"
" Linux 二进制 .ko 不属于兼容目标。POSIX 不定义内核模块格式或模块加载接口。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefNT uses Linux-style ELF64 .ko files, Kbuild, module metadata, and symbol versioning. Modules"
" must be rebuilt for a matching ReliefNT kernel; internal Linux kernel APIs and upstream Linux "
"binary .ko files are not compatibility targets. POSIX defines neither a kernel module format nor a"
" module loading interface."

msgid ""
"默认 defconfig 的生产驱动为 y；已开放的 tristate 可以在 menuconfig 中 选择 m。关闭 MODULES 时不能选择 m，内建配置仍可构建。测试模块由 "
"MODULE_TESTS 显式开启，不进入默认产品。 完整生产部件及依赖矩阵见 :doc:`../core-api/drivers`。"
msgstr ""
"Production drivers in the default defconfig are y; exposed tristates can be set to m in "
"menuconfig. With MODULES disabled, m cannot be selected, but built-in configurations can still be "
"built. Test modules require explicit MODULE_TESTS enablement and are not part of the default "
"product. See :doc:`../core-api/drivers` for the full production component and dependency matrix."

msgid "构建与安装"
msgstr "Building and Installing"

msgid "在 ReliefNT 源码根目录执行::"
msgstr "Run from the ReliefNT source root::"

msgid ""
"modules 使用固定的 Linux 6.12 编译、modpost 和最终链接规则，生成 "
"Module.symvers、modules.order、modules.builtin、modules.builtin.modinfo 与选中的 .ko。modules_prepare "
"准备宿主工具和生成头文件；它不替代生成 完整符号版本清单所需的内核构建。"
msgstr ""
"modules uses pinned Linux 6.12 compilation, modpost, and final linking rules to generate "
"Module.symvers, modules.order, modules.builtin, modules.builtin.modinfo, and the selected .ko "
"files. modules_prepare prepares host tools and generated headers; it does not replace the kernel "
"build needed to generate a complete symbol version manifest."

msgid ""
"完整原生 release 保存在 O/include/config/kernel.release，ABI 摘要在 O/include/config/module.abi。安装目录为 "
"/lib/modules/<release>/kernel/， 树外模块使用 updates/。只清理由相应安装清单管理的旧产物，保留其他 release "
"和用户模块。覆盖已修改的受管文件会导致明确错误；不再生成的旧文件若被 用户修改则予以保留，不将它作为陈旧产物删除。"
msgstr ""
"The full native release is stored in O/include/config/kernel.release, and the ABI digest in "
"O/include/config/module.abi. Installation uses /lib/modules/<release>/kernel/, with updates/ for "
"out-of-tree modules. Only old artifacts managed by the corresponding installation manifest are "
"cleaned up; other releases and user modules are retained. Overwriting a modified managed file "
"produces an explicit error. A formerly generated file modified by the user is preserved rather "
"than removed as stale."

msgid "模块元数据"
msgstr "Module Metadata"

msgid ""
"默认构建的最终 ``.ko`` 导出表保留 Linux 风格的 ``__ksymtab_<符号名>``、 ``__kstrtab_<符号名>`` 与 ``__kstrtabns_<符号名>`` "
"标签，供模块工具建立 符号索引。普通和 GPL 导出、函数和数据导出都使用这些标签；原生表项仍为 地址、名称和命名空间三个指针。``Module.symvers`` 记录类型 CRC，不能用 "
"普通全局符号表代替实际导出清单。"
msgstr ""
"The final ``.ko`` export table in a default build retains Linux-style ``__ksymtab_<符号名>``, "
"``__kstrtab_<符号名>``, and ``__kstrtabns_<符号名>`` labels so module tools can build symbol indexes. "
"Normal and GPL exports, and function and data exports, all use these labels; native entries still "
"contain three pointers: address, name, and namespace. ``Module.symvers`` records type CRCs; an "
"ordinary global symbol table cannot replace the actual export manifest."

msgid ""
"依赖这些标签的模块工具需要保留本地符号。安装时 ``INSTALL_MOD_STRIP=1`` 仅剥除调试信息，保留这些标签；自定义 ``--strip-unneeded`` 或 "
"``--strip-all`` 会移除标签，不适用于依赖标签扫描的 ``depmod``。"
msgstr ""
"Module tools that depend on these labels need local symbols preserved. At installation, "
"``INSTALL_MOD_STRIP=1`` strips only debug information and retains the labels. Custom ``--strip-"
"unneeded`` or ``--strip-all`` removes them and is unsuitable for ``depmod`` that scans labels."

msgid ""
"``modules.builtin`` 列出内置模块路径；``modules.builtin.modinfo`` 保存 以模块名加点号为前缀、以 NUL 分隔的元数据。模块工具需要读取这些文件 "
"才能查询内置模块及其别名。内置模块不写入动态 ``/proc/modules`` 列表， 也不生成用于冒充可加载模块的 ``.ko`` 文件。文件约定见 `Linux Kbuild 输出文件 "
"<https://docs.kernel.org/kbuild/kbuild.html#output-files>`_。"
msgstr ""
"``modules.builtin`` lists built-in module paths; ``modules.builtin.modinfo`` holds NUL-separated "
"metadata prefixed with the module name and a dot. Module tools must read these files to query "
"built-in modules and their aliases. Built-in modules are not added to the dynamic "
"``/proc/modules`` list, and no ``.ko`` files are generated to impersonate loadable modules. See "
"`Linux Kbuild output files <https://docs.kernel.org/kbuild/kbuild.html#output-files>`_ for file "
"conventions."

msgid "树外模块"
msgstr "Out-of-Tree Modules"

msgid "模块目录中的 Kbuild::"
msgstr "Kbuild in the module directory::"

msgid ""
"hello.c 使用 reliefnt/module.h 的 module_init、module_exit 和 MODULE_LICENSE 等接口。导出符号须使用 "
"reliefnt/export.h；外置模块采用 原生模块的地址模型，不能沿用内建内核的直接地址或静态 DMA 假设。"
msgstr ""
"hello.c uses interfaces such as module_init, module_exit, and MODULE_LICENSE from "
"reliefnt/module.h. Exported symbols must use reliefnt/export.h. External modules use the native "
"module address model and must not retain the direct-address or static-DMA assumptions of the "
"built-in kernel."

msgid "使用完整源码与已有输出时::"
msgstr "With the full source and existing output::"

msgid "也可以导出独立 prepared SDK::"
msgstr "A standalone prepared SDK can also be exported::"

msgid ""
"prepared SDK 带匹配头文件、生成配置、ABI、Module.symvers，以及原版 fixdep、genksyms、modpost 和 Kbuild "
"输入。它不带内核实现源码，也不通过 重新编译整个内核来构建树外模块。源码/输出树仍可用时直接调用 M=；部署后的 /lib/modules/<release>/build 指向同一前缀内的 "
"prepared SDK。"
msgstr ""
"The prepared SDK includes matching headers, generated configuration, ABI, Module.symvers, and "
"upstream fixdep, genksyms, modpost, and Kbuild inputs. It contains no kernel implementation source"
" and builds out-of-tree modules without recompiling the entire kernel. Call M= directly while the "
"source/output trees remain available; deployed /lib/modules/<release>/build points to the prepared"
" SDK under the same prefix."

msgid ""
"该 SDK 支持与生成它的 Linux x86_64 宿主工具环境相匹配的构建。目标工具 必须具有匹配身份；允许同一工具搬到其他目录，并可显式传入 CC、AR、LD、 "
"OBJCOPY。改变内核架构、PROFILE、编译策略或头文件应从完整源码重新构建并 导出新的 SDK，不能继续沿用旧 ABI 标记。SDK 本身可只读，构建产物与临时 文件写入 M= "
"目录；模块安装仍需指定可写的 INSTALL_MOD_PATH。 沿用 Linux Kbuild 的路径要求，SDK 和构建目录不能包含空白字符。"
msgstr ""
"The SDK supports builds matching the Linux x86_64 host tool environment that generated it. Target "
"tools must have matching identities; the same tools may move to other directories, and CC, AR, LD,"
" and OBJCOPY can be passed explicitly. Changes to the kernel architecture, PROFILE, compilation "
"policy, or headers require rebuilding from full source and exporting a new SDK rather than reusing"
" old ABI markers. The SDK itself may be read-only; artifacts and temporary files go into the M= "
"directory. Module installation still requires a writable INSTALL_MOD_PATH. Linux Kbuild path "
"requirements apply: SDK and build directories must not contain whitespace."

msgid "加载诊断"
msgstr "Loading Diagnostics"

msgid ""
"加载器校验完整 vermagic、类型 CRC、依赖和参数，并实现 Linux 编号的 init_module、finit_module、delete_module；调用者需要 "
"CAP_SYS_MODULE。 finit_module 不支持的装载标志明确返回错误。delete_module 与 Linux 6.12 禁用强制卸载的配置一致，接受 BusyBox 使用的 "
"O_EXCL，并忽略额外位； O_TRUNC 也不会绕过引用、exit 或硬件停止检查。finit_module 使用独立文件快照，不移动共享 "
"文件偏移；已有可写文件描述会阻止快照，快照期间也不能新增可写打开。"
msgstr ""
"The loader checks the full vermagic, type CRCs, dependencies, and parameters, and implements "
"Linux-numbered init_module, finit_module, and delete_module; callers require CAP_SYS_MODULE. "
"Unsupported finit_module loading flags return explicit errors. Like Linux 6.12 with forced "
"unloading disabled, delete_module accepts the O_EXCL used by BusyBox and ignores extra bits; even "
"O_TRUNC cannot bypass reference, exit, or hardware-stop checks. finit_module uses an independent "
"file snapshot without moving the shared file offset. Existing writable file descriptions block the"
" snapshot, and new writable opens are prohibited during it."

msgid ""
"模块状态为 COMING、LIVE、GOING。LIVE 表示代码加载成功，是否发现并激活 硬件应检查驱动状态，不能把没有相应硬件的成功注册当作硬件验证。 "
"打开设备、挂载、映射、依赖和执行中的回调会约束卸载；设备停止失败时保留 代码与 DMA 所有权以便诊断和重试。/proc/modules 与 /sys/module 提供状态视图。"
msgstr ""
"Module states are COMING, LIVE, and GOING. LIVE means code loaded successfully; check driver state"
" to determine whether hardware was discovered and activated. Successful registration without the "
"corresponding hardware is not hardware validation. Open devices, mounts, mappings, dependencies, "
"and executing callbacks constrain unloading. If device shutdown fails, code and DMA ownership are "
"retained for diagnosis and retry. /proc/modules and /sys/module expose state views."

msgid ""
"模块参数遵循 Linux 风格的 ``module_param`` 类型、命令行解析和 sysfs 权限。 例如 DRM 的只读布尔参数 ``faildiag`` 可在内核命令行中写为 "
"``drm.faildiag=1``，或在装载时使用 ``modprobe drm faildiag=1``。 内置驱动由内核参数框架处理，外置驱动由 modprobe 传入同一参数描述表； "
"诊断在初始化时设置。使用 ``0`` 或 ``N`` 可禁用，非法布尔值会拒绝装载。 只读或权限为零的参数不能从 sysfs 任意修改；卸载后的旧参数句柄不能指向 "
"重新加载模块的存储。模块版本与导出符号类型 CRC 不匹配必须重新构建， 不提供忽略 vermagic 或 CRC 的强制装载选项。模块内存采用独立的代码、只读 "
"和可写区域，页权限与直映射别名同时约束，所有 CPU 保持 WP/NXE。"
msgstr ""
"Module parameters follow Linux-style ``module_param`` types, command-line parsing, and sysfs "
"permissions. For example, DRM's read-only Boolean ``faildiag`` can be set with ``drm.faildiag=1`` "
"on the kernel command line or ``modprobe drm faildiag=1`` at loading. Built-in drivers are handled"
" by the kernel parameter framework; modprobe passes parameters to external drivers using the same "
"parameter descriptor table. Diagnostics are set at initialization. Use ``0`` or ``N`` to disable; "
"invalid Boolean values reject loading. Read-only or zero-permission parameters cannot be changed "
"arbitrarily through sysfs; stale parameter handles after unloading must not point into a reloaded "
"module's storage. Module version or exported-symbol type CRC mismatches require rebuilding; no "
"forced-load option ignores vermagic or CRCs. Module memory uses separate code, read-only, and "
"writable regions, with both page permissions and direct-map aliases constrained, and WP/NXE "
"retained on every CPU."

msgid ""
"未定义弱符号只有在确实没有对应导出时才解析为零。若同名导出存在，但类型 CRC、许可证或 namespace 不匹配，加载仍须失败；弱绑定不能绕过这些检查。 x86_64 加载器支持 "
"NONE、64、32、32S、PC32、PLT32 与 PC64 重定位； 未知类型或不可表示的结果会被拒绝。32S 按符号扩展检查，合法负值不会仅因 其为负而被拒绝；越界时不写入目标位置。"
msgstr ""
"Undefined weak symbols resolve to zero only when no corresponding export exists. If an export with"
" the same name exists but its type CRC, license, or namespace does not match, loading must still "
"fail; weak binding cannot bypass these checks. The x86_64 loader supports NONE, 64, 32, 32S, PC32,"
" PLT32, and PC64 relocations. Unknown types or unrepresentable results are rejected. 32S is "
"checked using sign extension, so valid negative values are not rejected merely for being negative;"
" out-of-range results do not write the target location."

msgid "初始化代码随模块保留到卸载，首版不提供 Linux 内部 ``__init`` API 或 初始化段提前回收。模块初始化结束并不能证明注册的回调已不再引用这些段。"
msgstr ""
"Initialization code remains with the module until unloading. The first version provides neither "
"the Linux internal ``__init`` API nor early reclamation of initialization sections. Completion of "
"module initialization does not prove registered callbacks no longer reference those sections."

msgid "根文件系统模块的启动加载、模块管理命令与镜像更新集成由 ReliefOS 构建链 负责；应分别验证编译、打包、BIOS/UEFI 启动和实际设备操作。"
msgstr ""
"The ReliefOS build chain handles boot-time loading of root-filesystem modules, module management "
"commands, and image-update integration. Compilation, packaging, BIOS/UEFI boot, and actual device "
"operations should be validated separately."
